{"id":451,"date":"2020-07-25T11:05:40","date_gmt":"2020-07-25T11:05:40","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/themes.webdevia.com\/bathrooms-wordpress-theme\/kitchens-demo\/?post_type=portfolio&#038;p=451"},"modified":"2024-03-21T17:25:58","modified_gmt":"2024-03-21T17:25:58","slug":"consectetur-adipiscing-2","status":"publish","type":"portfolio","link":"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/blog\/portfolio\/consectetur-adipiscing-2\/","title":{"rendered":"A Great Loft-Style Kitchen Upgrade"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Description:<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our team transformed a dated and cramped kitchen into a bright and spacious modern oasis. The client wanted a clean and contemporary look with ample storage and functional layout. We worked closely with the client to design a custom solution that perfectly suited their needs and style preferences.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"733\" height=\"900\" data-id=\"2495\" src=\"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/banner_3.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2495\" srcset=\"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/banner_3.webp 733w, https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/banner_3-244x300.webp 244w, https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/banner_3-600x737.webp 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 733px) 100vw, 733px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"733\" height=\"900\" data-id=\"2494\" src=\"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/banner_2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2494\" srcset=\"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/banner_2.webp 733w, https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/banner_2-244x300.webp 244w, https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/banner_2-600x737.webp 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 733px) 100vw, 733px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Features:<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Sleek white shaker-style cabinets with matte black hardware<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quartz countertops with waterfall edge on the island<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Subway tile backsplash in a herringbone pattern<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Open shelving for displaying decorative items and cookbooks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Integrated under-cabinet lighting for task illumination<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Stainless steel appliances for a sleek and cohesive look<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Challenges:<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The main challenge of this project was maximizing storage in a limited space. We addressed this by incorporating tall cabinets, deep drawers, and pull-out pantry shelves. Additionally, we reconfigured the layout to create a more open and functional kitchen area.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Sika INTERIOR DESIGN &amp; OFFICE Fit out - Liqui Group\" width=\"900\" height=\"506\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/jj20j48zZjc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Outcome:<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The result was a stunning and functional modern white kitchen that exceeded the client&#8217;s expectations. The clean lines, bright color palette, and thoughtful design elements created a welcoming and inviting space for cooking, dining, and entertaining. The client was thrilled with the transformation and now enjoys spending time in their beautiful new kitchen.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2748,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","projet":[25],"class_list":["post-451","portfolio","type-portfolio","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","projet-installation"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/portfolio\/451","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/portfolio"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/portfolio"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=451"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/2748"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=451"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"projet","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-st